Z||000003||kupop87gt||03-12-2000||08:10 PM||||To actually convert to a GT you have to have the front and rear fascias in order. Then there's the seats and gauge package and steering wheel and wheels. The RPO codes are tell-tale of course.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Monkeyman||03-12-2000||08:14 PM||||Assuming you convert to a GT the right way (i.e. change all of the badging, etc.), there's no way to tell the difference other than through the VIN #.||||reg||1
